# Regenerate all demos: npm run demo
Output demo/alias.gif

Set FontSize 18
Set Width 880
Set Height 420
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 75ms

Hide
Type `. demo/setup.sh && cd "$HOME" && clear`
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show

# alias claude to "claudes --" for your shell
Type "claudes"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "a"
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Sleep 3s
